Statement of modifications (GPL-3.0 section 5a)
-----------------------------------------------

Modified by Martina Bellio, from 2026-09-20.

The purpose of the modification is to let animal outlines produced by an
external instance-segmentation model (a fine-tuned Detectron2 Mask R-CNN)
enter idtracker.ai directly, instead of being rendered back into a video
for idtracker.ai to re-threshold. Identity tracking is deliberately left
as it was: crossing detection, fragmentation, identification and gap
closing are unmodified.

Files changed relative to the fork point:

  src/idtrackerai/base/animals_detection/segmentation.py
      process_frame() takes an optional external contour source and frame
      number, and short-circuits to contours_from_external() instead of
      thresholding. New function contours_from_external().

  src/idtrackerai/base/animals_detection/animals_detection.py
      Validates the contour file against the video before segmenting, and
      disables background subtraction when external contours are in use.

  src/idtrackerai/session.py
      New external_contours parameter, resolved and checked in
      prepare_tracking().

  src/idtrackerai/segmentation_app/main.py
  src/idtrackerai/segmentation_app/widgets/__init__.py
  src/idtrackerai/segmentation_app/widgets/frame_analyzer.py
  src/idtrackerai/segmentation_app/tooltips.toml
      Segmentation App gains a source selector for choosing between
      thresholding and external contours.

  pyproject.toml
      Distribution renamed to idtrackerai-detectron2 to distinguish it
      from the upstream release. The import name idtrackerai is unchanged.

  README.md
      Replaced. The upstream README is preserved as README.idtrackerai.md.

Files added:

  src/idtrackerai/base/animals_detection/external_contours.py
      Sidecar contour format and reader.

  src/idtrackerai/segmentation_app/widgets/segmentation_source.py
      The segmentation source selector widget.

  tests/external_contours_test.py
      Tests for the above.

  tools/
      Pipeline that produces the contour files: frame sampling for
      annotation, LabelMe to COCO conversion, Mask R-CNN fine-tuning,
      batch inference, video preflight, and a Colab notebook.

  docs/Automated behaviour tracking workflow.txt
      Methods write-up for the earlier enhanced-video workflow this
      replaces.

  NOTICE, CITATION.cff
      This file and citation metadata.


